{
  "version": 1,
  "minor_version": 1,
  "key": "lovelace.dashboard_house_status",
  "data": {
    "config": {
      "title": "House Status",
      "views": [
        {
          "title": "Domestic Energy Consumption",
          "path": "domestic-energy-consumption",
          "icon": "mdi:home-lightning-bolt",
          "type": "sections",
          "max_columns": 4,
          "sections": [
            {
              "type": "grid",
              "column_span": 4,
              "cards": [
                {
                  "type": "markdown",
                  "content": "## Domestic energy consumption\nElectricity used *(excluding battery and car charging)*, export and gas. Costs shown in £."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "grid",
              "column_span": 4,
              "cards": [
                {
                  "type": "custom:apexcharts-card",
                  "header": {
                    "show": true,
                    "title": "Today · half-hour energy cost",
                    "show_states": false
                  },
                  "graph_span": "24h",
                  "span": {
                    "start": "day"
                  },
                  "now": {
                    "show": true,
                    "label": "Now"
                  },
                  "apex_config": {
                    "chart": {
                      "height": 380,
                      "toolbar": {
                        "show": false
                      }
                    },
                    "legend": {
                      "show": false
                    },
                    "stroke": {
                      "curve": "straight"
                    },
                    "dataLabels": {
                      "enabled": false
                    }
                  },
                  "yaxis": [
                    {
                      "id": "price",
                      "decimals": 0,
                      "apex_config": {
                        "title": {
                          "text": "p/kWh"
                        }
                      }
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "cost",
                      "opposite": true,
                      "decimals": 2,
                      "apex_config": {
                        "title": {
                          "text": "£ / 30 min"
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  ],
                  "series": [
                    {
                      "entity": "sensor.lifeos_energy_tariff_horizon",
                      "name": "Price",
                      "type": "line",
                      "unit": "p/kWh",
                      "yaxis_id": "price",
                      "stroke_width": 2,
                      "extend_to": false,
                      "data_generator": "return (entity.attributes.slots || []).filter(x => x.import_p_per_kwh !== null && new Date(x.local_from).toDateString() === new Date().toDateString()).map(x => [new Date(x.local_from).getTime(), Number(x.import_p_per_kwh)]);"
                    },
                    {
                      "entity": "sensor.lifeos_energy_report",
                      "name": "Used",
                      "type": "column",
                      "unit": "£",
                      "yaxis_id": "cost",
                      "extend_to": false,
                      "data_generator": "return (entity.attributes.intervals || []).filter(x => x.domestic_import_cost_gbp !== null).map(x => [new Date(x.valid_from).getTime(), Number(x.domestic_import_cost_gbp.toFixed(4))]);"
                    },
                    {
                      "entity": "sensor.lifeos_energy_report",
                      "name": "Export",
                      "type": "column",
                      "unit": "£",
                      "yaxis_id": "cost",
                      "extend_to": false,
                      "data_generator": "return (entity.attributes.intervals || []).filter(x => x.export_earnings_gbp !== null).map(x => [new Date(x.valid_from).getTime(), -Number(x.export_earnings_gbp.toFixed(4))]);"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "grid",
              "column_span": 4,
              "cards": [
                {
                  "type": "markdown",
                  "content": "### Electricity used\n# £{{ states('sensor.lifeos_domestic_import_cost') | float(0) | round(2) }}\n**{{ states('sensor.lifeos_domestic_import_energy') | float(0) | round(2) }} kWh** · {{ states('sensor.lifeos_average_import_price') | float(0) | round(1) }} p/kWh"
                },
                {
                  "type": "markdown",
                  "content": "### Export earned\n# £{{ states('sensor.lifeos_export_earnings') | float(0) | round(2) }}\n**{{ states('sensor.lifeos_export_energy') | float(0) | round(2) }} kWh** · {{ states('sensor.lifeos_average_export_price') | float(0) | round(1) }} p/kWh"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "grid",
              "column_span": 4,
              "cards": [
                {
                  "type": "markdown",
                  "content": "### Net electricity\n# £{{ states('sensor.lifeos_net_electricity_cost') | float(0) | round(2) }}\nBattery charging excluded"
                },
                {
                  "type": "markdown",
                  "content": "### Gas\n# £{{ states('sensor.octopus_energy_gas_e6e16309692443_2200667301_previous_accumulative_cost') | float(0) | round(2) }}\n{{ states('sensor.octopus_energy_gas_e6e16309692443_2200667301_previous_accumulative_consumption_kwh') | float(0) | round(2) }} kWh · latest meter period"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Full Energy Flow",
          "path": "full-energy-flow",
          "icon": "mdi:transmission-tower",
          "type": "sections",
          "max_columns": 4,
          "sections": [
            {
              "type": "grid",
              "column_span": 4,
              "cards": [
                {
                  "type": "markdown",
                  "content": "## Full energy flow\nGrid import and export split by source. House usage, battery charging/discharging and car charging. Costs shown in £."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "grid",
              "column_span": 4,
              "cards": [
                {
                  "type": "custom:apexcharts-card",
                  "header": {
                    "show": true,
                    "title": "Full energy flow",
                    "show_states": false
                  },
                  "graph_span": "24h",
                  "span": {
                    "start": "day"
                  },
                  "now": {
                    "show": true,
                    "label": "Now"
                  },
                  "apex_config": {
                    "chart": {
                      "height": 390,
                      "toolbar": {
                        "show": false
                      }
                    },
                    "plotOptions": {
                      "bar": {
                        "columnWidth": "85%"
                      }
                    },
                    "legend": {
                      "show": true,
                      "position": "bottom"
                    }
                  },
                  "yaxis": [
                    {
                      "id": "power",
                      "decimals": 2,
                      "apex_config": {
                        "title": {
                          "text": "kW"
                        }
                      }
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "price",
                      "opposite": true,
                      "decimals": 2,
                      "apex_config": {
                        "title": {
                          "text": "p/kWh"
                        }
                      }
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "soc",
                      "opposite": true,
                      "min": 0,
                      "max": 100,
                      "show": false
                    }
                  ],
                  "series": [
                    {
                      "entity": "sensor.lifeos_house_demand_power",
                      "name": "House usage",
                      "type": "column",
                      "yaxis_id": "power",
                      "group_by": {
                        "func": "avg",
                        "duration": "30min"
                      }
                    },
                    {
                      "entity": "sensor.lifeos_battery_charge_power",
                      "name": "Battery charging",
                      "type": "column",
                      "yaxis_id": "power",
                      "group_by": {
                        "func": "avg",
                        "duration": "30min"
                      }
                    },
                    {
                      "entity": "sensor.lifeos_grid_export_power",
                      "name": "Grid export",
                      "type": "column",
                      "yaxis_id": "power",
                      "transform": "return -Math.abs(x);",
                      "group_by": {
                        "func": "avg",
                        "duration": "30min"
                      }
                    },
                    {
                      "entity": "sensor.lifeos_energy_tariff_horizon",
                      "name": "Electricity price",
                      "type": "line",
                      "unit": "p/kWh",
                      "yaxis_id": "price",
                      "stroke_width": 3,
                      "extend_to": false,
                      "data_generator": "return (entity.attributes.slots || []).filter(x => x.import_p_per_kwh !== null).map(x => [new Date(x.local_from).getTime(), x.import_p_per_kwh]);"
                    },
                    {
                      "entity": "sensor.lifeos_energy_battery_soc",
                      "name": "Battery SOC",
                      "type": "line",
                      "unit": "%",
                      "yaxis_id": "soc",
                      "stroke_width": 2
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "grid",
              "column_span": 4,
              "cards": [
                {
                  "type": "markdown",
                  "content": "### House usage\n**£{{ states('sensor.lifeos_domestic_import_cost') }}** · {{ states('sensor.lifeos_domestic_import_energy') }} kWh\n\nGrid-fed home-battery charging excluded."
                },
                {
                  "type": "markdown",
                  "content": "### Battery\nSOC **{{ states('sensor.lifeos_energy_battery_soc') }}%**\n\nCharge/discharge live power shown in chart; cost attribution remains measured-only."
                },
                {
                  "type": "markdown",
                  "content": "### EV / car charging\n**Not installed**\n\n£0 · 0 kWh. Charge-only slot; no V2G/V2H."
                },
                {
                  "type": "markdown",
                  "content": "### Export earnings\n**£{{ states('sensor.lifeos_export_earnings') }}** · {{ states('sensor.lifeos_export_energy') }} kWh"
                },
                {
                  "type": "markdown",
                  "content": "### Gas used\n**£{{ states('sensor.octopus_energy_gas_e6e16309692443_2200667301_previous_accumulative_cost') | float(0) | round(2) }}**\n{{ states('sensor.octopus_energy_gas_e6e16309692443_2200667301_previous_accumulative_consumption_kwh') | float(0) | round(2) }} kWh"
                },
                {
                  "type": "markdown",
                  "content": "### Total energy cost\n# £{{ ((states('sensor.lifeos_domestic_import_cost') | float(0)) + (states('sensor.octopus_energy_gas_e6e16309692443_2200667301_previous_accumulative_cost') | float(0)) - (states('sensor.lifeos_export_earnings') | float(0))) | round(2) }}\nElectricity + gas − export"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Home Status",
          "path": "home-status",
          "icon": "mdi:home-eye",
          "type": "sections",
          "max_columns": 4,
          "sections": [
            {
              "type": "grid",
              "column_span": 4,
              "cards": [
                {
                  "type": "grid",
                  "columns": 2,
                  "square": false,
                  "cards": [
                    {
                      "type": "markdown",
                      "content": "## ⚪ Security sensors not installed\nHouse secure is intentionally not asserted until all monitored external apertures are installed and healthy."
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "button",
                      "name": "Leave House · automation pending",
                      "icon": "mdi:home-export-outline",
                      "show_state": false,
                      "tap_action": {
                        "action": "none"
                      },
                      "hold_action": {
                        "action": "none"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "grid",
              "column_span": 4,
              "cards": [
                {
                  "type": "picture-elements",
                  "image": "/local/house-status/placeholder-floorplan.svg",
                  "elements": [
                    {
                      "type": "state-icon",
                      "entity": "media_player.westcott_way_living_room_tv",
                      "title": "Living room TV",
                      "tap_action": {
                        "action": "none"
                      },
                      "hold_action": {
                        "action": "none"
                      },
                      "double_tap_action": {
                        "action": "none"
                      },
                      "style": {
                        "left": "31%",
                        "top": "70%"
                      }
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "state-label",
                      "entity": "media_player.westcott_way_living_room_tv",
                      "prefix": "Living TV: ",
                      "tap_action": {
                        "action": "none"
                      },
                      "style": {
                        "left": "31%",
                        "top": "78%",
                        "font-size": "13px",
                        "background": "rgba(0,0,0,.70)",
                        "padding": "5px 8px",
                        "border-radius": "8px"
                      }
                    }
                  ],
                  "title": "Ground Floor"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "grid",
              "column_span": 4,
              "cards": [
                {
                  "type": "button",
                  "name": "Leave House · automation pending",
                  "icon": "mdi:exit-run",
                  "entity": "script.house_status_leave_house",
                  "show_state": false,
                  "tap_action": {
                    "action": "none"
                  },
                  "title": "First Floor"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "grid",
              "column_span": 4,
              "cards": [
                {
                  "type": "markdown",
                  "content": "🟩 Window open　🟥 Window closed　🟩 External door open　🟥 External door closed　🟢 Light off　🔴 Light on　🟩 TV on　🟥 TV off　⚪ ! Device unavailable\n\nPlanned window/door/light overlays remain dormant until sensors are installed. Floorplan assets remain replaceable without changing entity mapping."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Doorbell",
          "path": "doorbell",
          "icon": "mdi:doorbell-video",
          "cards": [
            {
              "type": "picture-entity",
              "entity": "camera.front_door_live_view",
              "name": "Front Door",
              "camera_view": "live",
              "show_name": true,
              "show_state": true,
              "tap_action": {
                "action": "none"
              },
              "hold_action": {
                "action": "none"
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "grid",
              "columns": 2,
              "square": false,
              "cards": [
                {
                  "type": "tile",
                  "entity": "event.front_door_motion",
                  "name": "Last motion",
                  "icon": "mdi:motion-sensor"
                },
                {
                  "type": "tile",
                  "entity": "event.front_door_ding",
                  "name": "Last doorbell press",
                  "icon": "mdi:doorbell"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "markdown",
              "content": "### Current doorbell · Ring Front Door\nMotion and bell events are enrolled now. **Motion = 30 seconds** and **bell press = 90 seconds** for the presentation window. Repeated motion extends the active window.\n\nAutomatic navigation remains dormant until a supported shared-display control mechanism is proven; bedroom/private displays are not enrolled by default. The entity mapping is isolated so a future replacement doorbell can be swapped without redesigning this view."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}
